        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 JumpVerse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump higher. React faster. Don’t give up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JumpVerse is a precision-focused 2D platformer built for players who crave real challenge.<br>No hand-holding. No autopilot. No easy wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, your timing — and the next platform.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 What You Get Right Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>6 handcrafted levels</strong> with increasing difficulty<br>• Tight, skill-based jump mechanics<br>• Hidden paths &amp; collectible special coins<br>• Classic 2D pixel art with a nostalgic feel<br>• Fast restarts — no wasted time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake is yours.<br>Every success is earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 And This Is Just The Beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JumpVerse is actively expanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned content includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>A total of 18 full levels</strong><br>• New traps, obstacles &amp; mechanics<br>• Additional secrets and challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy now and get all future updates as development continues.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Who Is JumpVerse For?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for players who:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Love precise platformers<br>✔ Want to test their reflexes<br>✔ Enjoy discovering hidden routes<br>✔ Prefer skill over luck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for an easy ride — this isn’t it.<br>If you’re ready for a challenge — welcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 The Real Question</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not whether you’ll reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s how many times you’ll restart before you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into JumpVerse. Prove your skill.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 JumpVerse</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jump higher. React faster. Don’t give up.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JumpVerse is a precision-focused 2D platformer built for players who crave real challenge.<br>No hand-holding. No autopilot. No easy wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just you, your timing — and the next platform.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 What You Get Right Now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>6 handcrafted levels</strong> with increasing difficulty<br>• Tight, skill-based jump mechanics<br>• Hidden paths &amp; collectible special coins<br>• Classic 2D pixel art with a nostalgic feel<br>• Fast restarts — no wasted time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake is yours.<br>Every success is earned.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 And This Is Just The Beginning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JumpVerse is actively expanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planned content includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• <strong>A total of 18 full levels</strong><br>• New traps, obstacles &amp; mechanics<br>• Additional secrets and challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy now and get all future updates as development continues.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Who Is JumpVerse For?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is for players who:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✔ Love precise platformers<br>✔ Want to test their reflexes<br>✔ Enjoy discovering hidden routes<br>✔ Prefer skill over luck</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for an easy ride — this isn’t it.<br>If you’re ready for a challenge — welcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 The Real Question</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not whether you’ll reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s how many times you’ll restart before you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into JumpVerse. Prove your skill.</strong></p>",
